Z||000000||The Fieromaster||11-22-2001||06:38 AM||||Just wondering what other forums you guys are present and posting on??  Do they respect the Fiero?<P>I myself am on the DSM (diamond star motors - eclipse, talon, laser) forum at <A HREF="http://www.dsmtalk.com" TARGET=_blank>www.dsmtalk.com</A>  Its a great forum and they respect the Fiero... in fact when i made a comment about them (some post about a quad 4) allot of people are like,<BR>"those are nice cars"<BR>"those cars are fast"<BR>"if gm would not have quit making them they would RULE gm" - my fav!<P>See some other car fans are intellegent!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">         <FONT COLOR="red">"Raced That, Wrecked Better"</FONT>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_damon.gif">      <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif"">                 <BR><B>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000</B><BR><FONT COLOR="blue"><B>AIM: Fieromaster</B></FONT><BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">1985 GT ~ Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="maroon">1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX ~ Maroon w/ Hella Balls!(GSX = AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="green">1992 Mitsubishi Eclipse GS ~ soon will be turboed</FONT><BR></B>||||reg||10
